Weather data (fetched at runtime, not bundled)
----------------------------------------------
Weather data by Open-Meteo.com (https://open-meteo.com/), licensed under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Used from v1.4.0 through
Open-Meteo's free non-commercial API for the cloud forecast: "Is it clear?"
on Tonight, the cloud part of Tonight's Best scores, and the altitude chart
background. The Pages Function /api/weather fetches hourly cloud cover by
level and visibility for a 0.1 degree grid cell and caches it for up to an
hour. Attribution is shown next to the forecast and on the About page.
